# URL patterns lychee should NOT check (one regex per line). Behaviour
# (retries, timeouts, accepted status codes) lives in lychee.toml.
#
# Keep this list tight: every entry is a link we chose to stop verifying.
# Only add a host that is valid for humans but blocks or throttles CI.

# Badges: dynamic SVGs that rate-limit and occasionally 5xx from CI IPs.
^https?://img\.shields\.io/
^https?://shields\.io/

# GitHub avatar / user-content CDNs throttle anonymous CI traffic.
^https?://avatars\.githubusercontent\.com/
^https?://.*\.githubusercontent\.com/

# Illustrative endpoints that appear in docs, not live URLs.
^https?://localhost(:\d+)?
^https?://127\.0\.0\.1(:\d+)?
^https?://0\.0\.0\.0(:\d+)?
^https?://example\.(com|org|net)
